        "original_id": "f6c7fcb8-2b71-5608-9bd9-141416386187",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: TVPlayer, Amazon Fire TV\n- Concepts: live TV streaming, free-to-air channels, smart devices, video games\n\nFacts:\n- TVPlayer is a live TV streaming service that lets users watch free-to-air channels.\n- TVPlayer is available on desktops, smartphones, tablets, Apple TV 4th Generation, and Amazon Fire TV.\n- Amazon Fire TV allows users to play video games.\n- Amazon Fire TV supports gaming with the included remote, a mobile app, or an optional game controller.",
